stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Placed: customer checkout<br/>(optimistic accept)

    Placed --> Confirmed: StockReserved<br/>(from Inventory)
    Placed --> Compensated: ReservationRejected<br/>(from Inventory)

    Confirmed --> Shipped: ShipmentDispatched<br/>(from Shipping)
    Shipped --> Delivered: ShipmentDelivered

    Compensated --> [*]: payment released<br/>+ customer notified
    Delivered --> [*]

    Placed --> Cancelled: customer cancels
    Confirmed --> Cancelled: customer cancels<br/>(before dispatch)
    Cancelled --> [*]

    note right of Compensated
        New explicit state.
        Idempotent on
        ReservationRejected.EventId.
        Drives QA-4 (recoverability).
    end note

    note left of Placed
        Customer-facing copy:
        "order received,
        confirming with warehouse"
    end note
